WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:08.068
Customers keeps a record of every person and business you sell to. In this video, you’ll find a customer and see everything about them.

00:00:09.095 --> 00:00:16.178
Open Customers. Search and filter the list by status, lead, active, or inactive, and by tags or owner.

00:00:17.208 --> 00:00:21.795
Open one for their contact details, address, notes, and who looks after them.

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:32.401
Everything they buy is here too: purchases, subscriptions, and orders, with the total spent and their last purchase. Each order links straight to Order Tracking.

00:00:33.427 --> 00:00:39.891
Customers is where Order Tracking and Engagement start, and you can archive customers you no longer work with.
